A '''spaceport''' was located in the dual-level [[city]] of [[Mos Espa]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]]. It was located on the upper level of the city next to the [[upper sprawl]]. Both passenger and cargo [[Starship|ships]] arrived and departed from there. Following the [[death]] of [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure]], his [[majordomo]] [[Bib Fortuna]] assumed the title of [[Daimyo]] and took control of [[Jabba's criminal empire]]. To maintain control, Fortuna divided Mos Espa into three families, with the [[Tatooine Klatooinian family|Klatooinian family]] controlling the upper sprawl and spaceport.<ref name="Chapter 3" />
